For {colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s s{colorTagClose}:
• Incoming damage is reduced by {colorTagOpen}%(dmgAbsorbBuff_1)s/%(dmgAbsorbBuff_2)s/%(dmgAbsorbBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}
• Top forward speed is increased by {colorTagOpen}%(fwMaxSpeedBonus)s km/h{colorTagClose}
• Top reverse speed is increased by {colorTagOpen}%(bkMaxSpeedBonus)s km/h{colorTagClose}
• Engine power is increased by {colorTagOpen}%(enginePowerBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}
• Damage from ramming to enemy vehicles is increased by {colorTagOpen}%(rammingDamageBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}

When this Role Skill is active, your tracks will be destroyed by a single shot.
